{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Lucky 7 Machines 把單純的抽號過程變成充滿臨場感的小型演出，適合課堂活動、派對決定、抽獎與各類數字遊戲使用。它現時由原價 US $0.99 改為限時免費，可於 App Store 下載。</p>\n<img alt=\"限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460bb-75-174.webp\">\n<h2>物理模擬攪珠體驗</h2>\n<p>抽號過程以實時物理模擬呈現，波球互相碰撞並逐一落入結果盤，配合音效與觸感回饋。你可在總數 2 至 70 之間設定，每次抽出 1 至 10 個號碼，亦可搖動 iPhone 或 iPad 預先攪混波球。程式最多儲存七部獨立設定的機器，滑動即可切換，並自動在裝置記錄每次抽號結果。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-195-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-196-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-197-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-198-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-199-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-200-scaled.jpg\">\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Lucky 7 Machines</li>\n<li>應用類別：Entertainment</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T10:40:41.897522+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":304,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T10:33:09+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-17T11:37:33.731619+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T10:37:43.355119+00:00","content_hash":"eaa8af5f7550f542065035dee3c55d0e6b2544076ed7d3d53ac6f23cf5f2a0fe","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}